    "body": "# reusefirst v1.2.0\n\nThis release makes `reusefirst` the artifact and agent-facing skill name across\nthe public repository. The previous releases remain available while consumers\nmigrate to this canonical name.\n\n## Boundaries\n\nThis artifact is advisory and local-only. It does not install, execute, publish,\nrelease, authorize, sandbox, or secure external systems.\n\n## Integrity\n\nUse `SHA256SUMS` to verify downloaded archives. Released contents are immutable;\ncorrections will use a new version.\n"
